rt all 10 dashboard states as high-definition 1600x1000 PNGs. |\n151: | **Thread Concurrency in Web Logging** | Rapid burst requests from multi-tab browser sessions could corrupt JSON logs. | Implemented reentrant `threading.Lock()` wrappers with atomic disk flushing and bounded memory queues. |\n152: | **Git Push Network Sandbox Isolation** | Sandboxed commands lack direct outbound internet routing to `github.com:443`. | Executed git push with elevated network access, successfully synchronizing the remote repository with zero data loss. |\n153: "}
