patch (`smtp.gmail.com`, `smtp.office365.com`, or custom relays) with TLS encryption.\n102: - Automatically or on-demand sends styled HTML executive briefings containing health scores, active threats, RMM tools, network connections, and remediation receipts.\n103: \n104: ---\n105: \n106: ## ⚡ Quick Start\n107: \n108: ### 1-Click Launchers (Windows)\n109: Double-click any batch launcher in the project root:\n110: - **`start_all.bat`**: Starts both the EDR Cyber Dashboard (`:8888`) and the AdBlock Proxy (`:8080`).\n111: - **`start_dashboard.bat`**: Launches only the EDR Web Dashboard (`http://127.0.0.1:8888`).\n112: - **`start_adblocker.bat`**: Launches only the AdBlock Proxy on port `8080`.\n113: - **`run_tests.bat`**: Executes the master diagnostic testing suite.\n114: - **`generate_screenshots.bat`**: Re-generates all 10 visual screenshots in `screenshots/`.\n115: \n116: ---\n117: \n118: ## 💻 Terminal CLI Usage (`cli_scanner.py`)\n119: \n120: ```bash"}
